1. Free use by individuals

   If you are an individual, you may install and use Quarry, free of charge,
   on any number of computers. This includes paid work that you do on your
   own, for example as a freelancer or sole proprietor.

   An organization with only one user of Quarry is covered by this section
   and needs no commercial license.

2. Use by organizations

   An organization with two or more users of Quarry needs a commercial
   license for each of those users.

   Such an organization may evaluate Quarry free of charge for 30 days,
   counted from the day its second user starts using Quarry. After that, it
   must obtain commercial licenses or reduce its use to a single user.

   Commercial licenses are available from the copyright holder: see the end
   of this license.

